[49m[38;5;10m+      1[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! Differential tests: C `libStaticAlias.so` vs Rust `libStaticAlias.so`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //!
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! BOTH libraries are loaded with `libloading` and driven exclusively through
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      4[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! their exported `extern "C"` symbols, so the `#[no_mangle]` wrappers are part
