[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      6[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //!
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! ## Why everything runs under one global lock
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //!
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! `static_alias` owns a function-local `static int inner = 1;`. Each `.so` has
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! its own copy of that hidden state, and both start at `1` when the process
